  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.夜晚前往加纳村，持有【联络信】与船夫（90.73）对话传送至海岸。前往（28.33）处进入炼金之馆。",
      "type": "night-item-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆【联络信】获得方式参考《蔓延的邪恶》任务",
      "type": "item-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "◆持有【会员徽章】与船夫对话亦可传送至海岸",
      "type": "alternate-route-item",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "2.通过（11.12）处楼梯前往炼金之馆2楼，与大炼金师（66.27）对话，交出【联络信】获得【通行证】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "◆炼金之馆2楼（55.21）处护士尤美儿可回复生命与魔法",
      "type": "service-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "3.前往炼金之馆1楼房间（22.5）与书库管理员（80.70）对话下楼，通过（114.84）处红色传送石进入试炼之路。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "◆持有【会员徽章】与书库管理员对话，传送至地下书库",
      "type": "member-shortcut",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "◆试炼之路为随机迷宫，共9层；魔物为Lv.60~62魔甲守卫者（金怪）、战甲守卫者（银怪）",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "4.通过随机迷宫抵达试炼迷宫深处，与堕落者（15.21）对话，进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
